      "text": "POST /collections/evidence_v17/points/query\n{ \"prefetch\": [\n    {\"query\": [..1024 floats], \"using\": \"dense\", \"limit\": 40},\n    {\"query\": {\"indices\": [..], \"values\": [..]},\n     \"using\": \"bm25\", \"limit\": 40} ],\n  \"query\": {\"fusion\": \"rrf\"}, \"limit\": 50,\n  \"filter\": {\"must\": [\n    {\"key\": \"cik\", \"match\": {\"value\": \"320193\"}},\n    {\"key\": \"section_key\", \"match\": {\"any\": [\"risk_factors\",\"mdna\"]}},\n    {\"key\": \"filing_date\",\n     \"range\": {\"gte\": \"2024-01-01T00:00:00Z\"}} ]} }\n\nIllustrative values; issuer filter ≠ customer authorization\n50 fused candidates → qualified reranker → top 8; log latency",
