      "text": "# Example contracts; Python locally, dbt in lakehouse\nunique:    (accession_number, section_key, parser_version)\nrequired:  cik, filing_date, accepted_at, content_sha\ncoverage:  form-aware sections; not-applicable != failed\npublish:   expected chunks == visible chunks; no stale IDs\nfreshness: source-specific age, ingestion lag, outage budget",
