      "text": "EXPERIMENT LOG TEMPLATE — no measured values asserted\nrun_id, git_sha, fixture_hash, corpus_documents, chunks\nhardware, model_revision, index_release, retrieval_config\noffered_rps, concurrency, duration, warmup, cache_state\ncompleted, rejected, errors, queue_wait, latency_histograms\nquality_per_case, input_tokens, output_tokens, retries, cost\nclassification = measured | projection; projection assumptions",
